# Create an eight-lane General MIDI kit through real controls, in RAM only.
# The fixture already owns two Tracks; use its sole +Track3 header.
# Programs two lanes, then visits Lane and Step editors.
# For eight active lanes use drum-eight-lanes-playback.ux.
0 scenario bench-macro-v1
100 transport start
200 button LEFT_TOP down
400 encoder_value NAV 0.010
600 button LEFT_TOP up
1000 assert_mode sequencer.clip_launcher
1200 encoder_value NAV 0.010
1400 encoder_value OPT -0.010
1600 encoder_value NAV 0.010
1800 encoder_value NAV 0.010
2200 tap NAV 60
2600 marker track_type
2800 encoder_value NAV 0.010
3200 tap NAV 60
3600 marker kit_picker
3800 encoder_value NAV 0.010
4200 tap NAV 60
4800 marker drum_pattern
5200 button NAV down
5300 encoder_value NAV 0.010
5400 button NAV up
5800 tap MACRO_1 60
6000 tap MACRO_5 60
6200 encoder_value NAV 0.010
6400 tap MACRO_3 60
6600 tap MACRO_7 60
7000 marker drum_playback
7300 tap NAV 60
7800 marker lane_editor
8200 tap LEFT_TOP 60
8800 button NAV down
8900 encoder_value NAV 0.010
9000 button NAV up
9400 button MACRO_3 down
10500 button MACRO_3 up
11000 marker drum_step_editor
11400 encoder_value NAV 0.010
11800 encoder_value NAV 0.010
12200 encoder_value OPT 0.250
12600 encoder_value OPT 0.750
13000 encoder_value OPT 0.250
13400 encoder_value OPT 0.750
14000 tap LEFT_TOP 60
15000 transport stop
